1
00:00:00,390 --> 00:00:02,490
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
Howard, have you seen

2
00:00:02,490 --> 00:00:03,860
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)my girdle?!

3
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,490
(Howard:)No, Ma!

4
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:08,960
(Mrs Wolowitz:)I can't find it, and I'm late
for my Weight Watchers meeting!

5
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:11,100
(Howard:)Maybe it committed suicide!

6
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:12,530
(Howard:)Leave me alone!

7
00:00:14,770 --> 00:00:16,340
(Howard:)Now, where were we?

8
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:18,370
(Bernadette:)I believe you
were about

9
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:21,170
(Bernadette:)to rip off my uniform
with your teeth.

10
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:22,710
Bernadette?!

11
00:00:22,710 --> 00:00:24,080
(Howard:)What are you doing here?

12
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:26,210
(Katee Sackhoff:)Well, if I had to
guess, I'd say I'm here

13
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:27,810
(Katee Sackhoff:)because you saw me
earlier this evening,

14
00:00:27,810 --> 00:00:29,320
(Katee Sackhoff:)and you're still
hung up on me.

15
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:30,550
(Howard:)No, I'm not.

16
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:33,020
(Bernadette:)Clearly you are.

17
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:36,820
(Bernadette:)Otherwise, based
on past experience,

18
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:38,990
(Bernadette:)we'd be done by now.

19
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:42,460
(Howard:)Okay,
I'm a little confused here.

20
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,630
GEORGE TAKEI:
Oh, my.

21
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:46,170
(George Takei:)Can I help?

22
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:50,600
(Howard:)Not that kind of confused.

23
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,440
(Bernadette:)What's George
Takei doing here?

24
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:55,040
(Katee Sackhoff:)Howard, do you have
latent homosexual tendencies?

25
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:57,080
(Howard:)No, of course not.

26
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:58,680
(George Takei:)So you say.

27
00:00:58,680 --> 00:01:03,020
(George Takei:)Yet, here I am.

